use a gun except him?

375
00:26:21.500 --> 00:26:22.458
Yes.

376
00:26:22.542 --> 00:26:25.917
K2 and M4 platforms are similar,
so it’ll be easy to use.

377
00:26:27.417 --> 00:26:29.333
This looks the coolest.

378
00:26:30.167 --> 00:26:31.208
